  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India - Completion of Green Story&#x2019;s sustainability platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a DGGF loan Green Story B.V. is able to complete the B2B sustainability platform measuring, offsetting, and improving fashion environmental footprints at the product level. Green Story&#x2019;s mission is to empower 1 billion people to understand their impact and make choices that are better for the planet. This project will employ 20 developers in India to further develop Green Story&apos;s platform.</narrative>
  </description>
